    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency distribution \u2014 bimodality (p50 / p95 / p99 / max)",
      "description": "The p95-to-max gap IS the bimodality signature. NOTE: the warm/cold split cannot key on @initDuration \u2014 under SnapStart that field does not exist and every record classifies as warm. Restore time appears as 'Restore Duration' in the REPORT message and in separate RESTORE_REPORT records.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "efk64tufw3pj4e"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
